<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Investment FRN increased.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Investment FRN increased.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The five-year floating rate note issue for Guangdong Investment Ltd was oversubscribed and increased to US$100 million from US$80 million, arranger Schroders Asia said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The notes were priced at par to float at 140 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate. There are put options in year three and four.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top tier managers is 170 basis points.</p>
<p>Some 24 other banks have joined the syndication.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
